# Class: obo:PROMOT_0032014 (Difficulty walking short distance)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(obo:IAO_0000119 "ICF:555410497") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:PROMOT_0032014 "A difficulty to walk for less than a kilometre, such as walking around rooms or hallways, within a building or for short distances outside. This is distinct from the difficulty of moving around."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:PROMOT_0032014 "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927")
