# Class: obo:PROMOT_0032019 (Fatigable weakness of axial muscles)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(obo:IAO_0000119 "HP:0003473") Annotation(rdfs:comment "[PROMOT project] Mansoore Gholizade (definition reviewer)") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:PROMOT_0032019 "A type of weakness of the axial muscles (i.e., of the muscles of the head and neck, vertebral column, and intercostal muscles) that occurs after a muscle group is used and lessens if the muscle group has some rest. That is, there is diminution of the strength of the axial muscles with repetitive muscle actions."@en)
