AnnotationAssertion(obo:PROMOT_1000001 obo:PROMOT_0032019 "[Congenital myasthenic syndrom Scoping review] \"Performing a Rare Disease-Oriented Master Observational Trial\" initiative, European Joint Programme on Rare Diseases, https://www.promotinitiative.com/")
